#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:15
#: 6586544efd124f058eb24abe96e2caa4
msgid ""
"There is no `ActionSequence` / `actions.MoveJ` / `CustomAction` API. Skills "
"are **registered names** in YAML (`task_queue` → `skill`). Full parameter "
"docs: [docs/SKILLS_REFERENCE.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-"
"generator/docs/SKILLS_REFERENCE.md)."
msgstr ""
"没有 `ActionSequence` / `actions.MoveJ` / `CustomAction` 这类 API。技能是 YAML "
"里的**注册名**（`task_queue` → `skill`）。完整参数说明见 "
"[docs/SKILLS_REFERENCE.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-"
"generator/docs/SKILLS_REFERENCE.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:17
#: b6b9a0cd449f4875a2e8958ff6a268c7
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:19
#: 30473e5904584e2394d532708451f5b6
msgid "In the [lerobot_ros2](4-lerobot_ros2.md) monorepo this package:"
msgstr "在 [lerobot_ros2](4-lerobot_ros2.md) 单体仓库中，本包承担："

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:21
#: ac8f163e98df4b6f800415f3cfb2639c
msgid ""
"**Motion layer (`motion_generation`)** — turns task geometry and robot "
"constraints into `StageTarget` sequences and executes them via "
"`ROS2RobotInterface` (Cartesian, dual-arm sync, MoveJ, and so on)."
msgstr ""
"**运动层（`motion_generation`）**：把任务几何与机器人约束变成 `StageTarget` 序列，并通过 "
"`ROS2RobotInterface` 执行（笛卡尔 / 双臂同步 / MoveJ 等）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:22
#: ded8a1829726480fa6dd9bfd20ff86ee
msgid ""
"**Orchestration layer (`task_runtime`)** — runs a `task_queue` (YAML block "
"list) through the skill registry and runtime context; merges "
"`skill_defaults` / `skill_params`."
msgstr ""
"**编排层（`task_runtime`）**：用技能注册表与运行时上下文执行 `task_queue`（YAML 块列表）；合并 "
"`skill_defaults` / `skill_params`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:23
#: 1f665d972aa8499190fc7bdb1704c1bb
msgid ""
"**Around the edges** — Isaac Sim entity poses, sim reset, optional LeRobot "
"recording."
msgstr "**周边**：Isaac Sim 实体位姿、仿真 reset、可选的 LeRobot 录制。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:25
#: a9f8bb6acb3140a5803538c630531369
msgid ""
"It does **not** implement OCS2 / MPC or the Nav2 servers themselves; those "
"stay behind existing ROS 2 interfaces. Pure motion/queue paths depend on "
"`ROS2RobotInterface` (`ctx.interface`), not the LeRobot `ROS2Robot` class."
msgstr ""
"本包**不**实现 OCS2 / MPC 或 Nav2 服务器本体；它们仍走已有 ROS 2 接口。纯运动/队列路径只依赖 "
"`ROS2RobotInterface`（`ctx.interface`），不依赖 LeRobot 的 `ROS2Robot` 类。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:27
#: 0bbe1d8a32af4e71a1c63640b097a83d
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "前置要求"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:29
#: b2013f21a86747b38611c87468368a42
msgid "Same baseline as the lerobot_ros2 monorepo README:"
msgstr "与 lerobot_ros2 单体仓库 README 的基线一致："

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:31
#: 22fdf8b4bf52431f84f6eedd4ba41407
msgid "**Python 3.12**"
msgstr "**Python 3.12**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:32
#: c2e7f3a354bf411aaf4da522f4640880
msgid ""
"**ROS 2 Jazzy**, with the matching `install/setup.bash` (or overlay) sourced"
" so `rclpy` comes from that distro"
msgstr ""
"**ROS 2 Jazzy**，并已 source 对应的 `install/setup.bash`（或 overlay），使 `rclpy` "
"来自该发行版"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:34
#: b9e21a07700e4f27912c7e7b70a1c726
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:36
#: 159e7f1e86f340dbb648bd12674671a4
msgid ""
"Typical path is from a **lerobot_ros2** checkout (composer is "
"`submodules/robot_action_composer`):"
msgstr ""
"典型路径是在 **lerobot_ros2** 检出中安装（composer 位于 "
"`submodules/robot_action_composer`）："

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:38
#: 28c6913fed27456c83085afc998a3dd6
msgid ""
"./init.sh all-motion          # interface + robot_action_composer\n"
"./init.sh install-lerobot     # extra: PyTorch + lerobot + plugins (record / infer)\n"
"# or once: ./init.sh all"
msgstr ""
"./init.sh all-motion          # interface + robot_action_composer\n"
"./init.sh install-lerobot     # extra: PyTorch + lerobot + plugins (record / infer)\n"
"# or once: ./init.sh all"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:44
#: 5c1605aa2b0f4e739c1d59d775c9026d
msgid ""
"Manual install, still from the monorepo root, after the env is active. "
"Prefer **uv** and **`--no-deps`** so install does not pull `rclpy` from PyPI"
" (see the lerobot_ros2 README):"
msgstr ""
"手动安装仍在单体仓库根目录、环境已激活之后进行。推荐 **uv** 并加 **`--no-deps`**，避免从 PyPI 拉取 `rclpy`（见 "
"lerobot_ros2 README）："

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:46
#: b162629441a4446eaedf17af296df27a
msgid ""
"uv pip install -e submodules/ros2_robot_interface --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install -e submodules/robot_action_composer --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install \"viser>=0.2\"   # optional; grasp-generation UI (PyPI viser, not ros2-viser launch)"
msgstr ""
"uv pip install -e submodules/ros2_robot_interface --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install -e submodules/robot_action_composer --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install \"viser>=0.2\"   # optional; grasp-generation UI (PyPI viser, not ros2-viser launch)"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:52
#: 04d6c06bfa574968b1189129095a11da
msgid ""
"The composer README also shows `pip install -e "
"submodules/ros2_robot_interface` then `pip install -e "
"submodules/robot_action_composer`. Use that only inside the project venv; on"
" Ubuntu, system `pip` hits PEP 668. Optional extras named in "
"`pyproject.toml`: `[recording]` (LeRobot / `lerobot_robot_ros2`), `[grasp]` "
"(`viser>=0.2` for grasp-generation UI). That extra is not the fa-py-"
"libraries `./run.sh viser` launcher."
msgstr ""
"composer README 也写了 `pip install -e submodules/ros2_robot_interface` 再 `pip "
"install -e submodules/robot_action_composer`。只在项目虚拟环境内使用；Ubuntu 上系统 `pip` "
"会碰到 PEP 668。`pyproject.toml` 中的可选 extra：`[recording]`（LeRobot / "
"`lerobot_robot_ros2`）、`[grasp]`（`viser>=0.2`，抓取生成 UI）。该 extra **不是** fa-py-"
"libraries 的 `./run.sh viser` 启动器。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:54
#: b5cee6dba95f48df89b148161f3ba6e9
msgid ""
"Console scripts after install: `motion-generation`, `ros2-stack`, `grasp-"
"generation`, `check-isaac-pose`, `check-robot-status`."
msgstr ""
"安装后可用的控制台脚本：`motion-generation`、`ros2-stack`、`grasp-generation`、`check-"
"isaac-pose`、`check-robot-status`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:56
#: 5176e8e9f86444559a430f4d31dc138a
msgid "Layers"
msgstr "分层"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:58
#: cf839f2326074aa2bd268362a397d7bd
msgid ""
"**`motion_generation`** — what each motion segment looks like and how it is "
"sent."
msgstr "**`motion_generation`**：每一段运动长什么样、怎么发到机器人。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:60
#: 1c85cf98fc36474fb411603ed7adf70d
msgid ""
"`sequence/` — `StageTarget` / `ArmTarget` / `ArmStage`, builders such as "
"`build_single_arm_pick_sequence`, and `execute_stage_sequence` (calls "
"`ROS2RobotInterface`, wait-for-arrival, gripper timing)."
msgstr ""
"`sequence/`：`StageTarget` / `ArmTarget` / `ArmStage`，以及 "
"`build_single_arm_pick_sequence` 等 builder，还有 `execute_stage_sequence`（调用 "
"`ROS2RobotInterface`、到位等待、夹爪节拍）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:61
#: 2b1223685ae647378e80fa358f3f9538
msgid ""
"`tasks/` — geometry wrappers on top of that (handover, bimanual carry, "
"parallel pick, drawer, pick/place, MoveJ return used by dataset recording)."
msgstr "`tasks/`：在 sequence 之上的几何封装（交接、双臂搬运、并行抓取、抽屉、抓放、数据集录制用的 MoveJ 返回）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:63
#: 549d11238b574803a22c360b0b10e8ae
msgid ""
"**`task_runtime`** — which skills run, in what order, with which merged "
"params."
msgstr "**`task_runtime`**：按队列调用哪些技能、顺序如何、合并后的参数是什么。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:65
#: ffd095d517564bd18107217cade85067
msgid ""
"`runner.run_task_queue` — connect → FSM → optional env reset → "
"`QueueRuntimeContext` → each `task_queue` block (`ParallelSpec` allowed) → "
"`get_skill` → `execute_stage_sequence`."
msgstr ""
"`runner.run_task_queue`：连接机器人 → FSM → 可选环境 reset → 构造 `QueueRuntimeContext` "
"→ 顺序执行 `task_queue` 各块（支持 `ParallelSpec`）→ `get_skill` → "
"`execute_stage_sequence`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:66
#: 5bdddf5140464cd9971c950509ccd1d6
msgid ""
"`registry.py` — `register_skill(name, fn)` / `get_skill(name)`; unknown "
"names raise `KeyError` listing registered skills."
msgstr ""
"`registry.py`：`register_skill(name, fn)` / `get_skill(name)`；未知技能名会抛出 "
"`KeyError`（错误信息含已注册名列表）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:67
#: 1f950e51f97d48828f9edf9ba72d2015
msgid ""
"Each skill: `(ctx, params) -> (list[StageTarget], ExecutionMeta)`. Blocks "
"with no Cartesian stages return an empty list (pure nav, pure MoveJ, side-"
"effect-only)."
msgstr ""
"每个技能签名：`(ctx, params) -> (list[StageTarget], "
"ExecutionMeta)`。无笛卡尔阶段的块返回空列表（纯导航、纯 MoveJ、仅副作用）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:69
#: 7a011087c2cb4beeb058a2836eb4f66d
msgid ""
"YAML discovery scans `task_configs/**/*.yaml` and `robots/*/` (optional "
"vendor grouping `robots/<Vendor>/<Robot>/`). See "
"[docs/TASK_CONFIG_YAML.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-"
"generator/docs/TASK_CONFIG_YAML.md) and "
"[docs/ROBOT_CONFIG.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-"
"generator/docs/ROBOT_CONFIG.md)."
msgstr ""
"YAML 发现会扫描 `task_configs/**/*.yaml` 与 `robots/*/`（可选一层厂商分组 "
"`robots/<Vendor>/<Robot>/`）。见 "
"[docs/TASK_CONFIG_YAML.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-"
"generator/docs/TASK_CONFIG_YAML.md) 与 "
"[docs/ROBOT_CONFIG.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-"
"generator/docs/ROBOT_CONFIG.md)。"

